{"name":"Bronzed","hex":"#dd6633","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"bronzed","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["simple past and past participle of bronze"]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Coated in bronze.","Of skin: tanned by the sun."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/bronzed"}],"entries":[{"title":"Bronzing","blocks":[{"text":"Bronzing is a process by which a bronze-like surface is applied to other materials. Some bronzing processes are merely simulated finishes (patinas) applied to existing metal surfaces, or coatings of powdered metal that give the appearance of a solid metal surface. In other cases, an actual layer of heavy copper is electroplated onto an object to produce a bronze-like surface. This electroplating is the method traditionally used for \"bronzing\" of baby shoes, but to electroplate a non-conductive item like a baby shoe, a conductive material must first be applied, then the copper plating is done."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ab/Bronzed_baby_shoes.JPG/330px-Bronzed_baby_shoes.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bronzing","wikidata":"Q4974278"}],"images":[],"sounds":{},"pictures":[{"title":"Orange -- 2022 -- 9711","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/94/Orange_--_2022_--_9711.jpg/500px-Orange_--_2022_--_9711.jpg","ratio":1.5,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Orange_--_2022_--_9711.jpg","share":0.219375},{"title":"Orange -- 2022 -- 9721","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/Orange_--_2022_--_9721.jpg/500px-Orange_--_2022_--_9721.jpg","ratio":1,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Orange_--_2022_--_9721.jpg","share":0.21125},{"title":"Orange -- 2022 -- 9713","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9a/Orange_--_2022_--_9713.jpg/500px-Orange_--_2022_--_9713.jpg","ratio":1.5,"link":"htt